@host = localhost:8080
@token = super-secret-token

### Testar se o servidor está de boas
GET /health HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### New dev
POST /bilhete/create HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "texto":    "Oi, Anthony",
  "acessos":  "1",
  "tempo":    "0"
}

### List devs novamente esse :id pode estar errado
GET /teste?id=55&nome=anthony HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List devs novamente esse :id pode estar errado
GET /bilhete/busca?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}